  "notes": [
    "May add authority (grants, writes, roles or secrets) in: codehost-local, design, dispatch, engine-codex, engineering, fleet-ops, fleet-steward, github, grading, grafana, librarian. Auto-updates accept it; turn them off to review first.",
    "App-kind tasks are graded from apps-mcp with the module's own token (role apps.read)",
    "A health probe the host asks for, replacing Paperclip health keys",
    "Release updates file a kernel.apply, and codehost-local lands it",
    "A kernel job's reply shows as the agent's reply in every chat",
    "An aidenhq write waits for its record to end and says how",
    "Every agent is a record on Paperclip's no-op process adapter",
    "The health probe is a fixed set, status only, on its own key",
    "Verify-security's checks match the post-switch board and modules",
    "Signed posts ignore the params Paperclip's action route adds",
    "The post signature leaves out the companyId Paperclip injects",
    "A record-only agent clears env to {}",
    "Paperclip-setup imports personaOf again",
    "Verify-security's code checks pass after the switch and #638"
  ],
  "release": "2026.11.18.2"
}
